  "Q00504_CompetitionForTheBanditStronghold/35437-09.html": {
   "file": "Q00504_CompetitionForTheBanditStronghold/35437-09.html",
   "quest": 504,
   "text": "Messenger: I thought I made it clear that registration does not begin until one hour before the next siege at %nextSiege%.",
   "header": "Messenger",
   "when": [
    "!BANDIT_STRONGHOLD.isWaitingBattle()"
   ],
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00504_CompetitionForTheBanditStronghold/35437-04.html": {
   "file": "Q00504_CompetitionForTheBanditStronghold/35437-04.html",
   "quest": 504,
   "text": "Messenger: Your clan lacks the experience needed to form an alliance with the Ol Mahums! (This action can be taken only by the leader of a clan of level 4 or above.)",
   "header": "Messenger",
   "when": [
    "BANDIT_STRONGHOLD.isWaitingBattle(); ((clan == null) || (clan.getLevel() < 4))"
   ],
   "outcome": "refusal",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00504_CompetitionForTheBanditStronghold/35437-05.html": {
   "file": "Q00504_CompetitionForTheBanditStronghold/35437-05.html",
   "quest": 504,
   "text": "Messenger: You are not the leader of a clan, are you? (This action can be taken only by the leader of a clan of level 4 or above.)",
   "header": "Messenger",
   "when": [
    "BANDIT_STRONGHOLD.isWaitingBattle(); !((clan == null) || (clan.getLevel() < 4)); !player.isClanLeader()"
   ],
   "outcome": "refusal",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00504_CompetitionForTheBanditStronghold/35437-10.html": {
   "file": "Q00504_CompetitionForTheBanditStronghold/35437-10.html",
   "quest": 504,
   "text": "Messenger: What's the big idea, doesn't your clan already have a hall? Such greed! Surely you know the price of greed? Get out of here!",
   "header": "Messenger",
   "when": [
    "BANDIT_STRONGHOLD.isWaitingBattle(); !((clan == null) || (clan.getLevel() < 4)); player.isClanLeader(); ((clan.getHideoutId() > 0) || (clan.getFortId() > 0) || (clan.getCastleId() > 0))"
   ],
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00504_CompetitionForTheBanditStronghold/35437-03.html": {
   "file": "Q00504_CompetitionForTheBanditStronghold/35437-03.html",
   "quest": 504,
   "text": "Messenger: Preliminary tryouts begin one hour before the commencement of the clan hall siege... The next siege should begin around %nextSiege%. Come back then.",
   "header": "Messenger",
   "when": [
    "state CREATED; BANDIT_STRONGHOLD.isWaitingBattle(); !((clan == null) || (clan.getLevel() < 4)); player.isClanLeader(); !((clan.getHideoutId() > 0) || (clan.getFortId() > 0) || (clan.getCastleId() > 0))"
   ],
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00504_CompetitionForTheBanditStronghold/35437-01.htm": {
   "file": "Q00504_CompetitionForTheBanditStronghold/35437-01.htm",
   "quest": 504,
   "text": "Messenger: Are you allies of one of the five factions trying to take over this clan hall? What has brought us to this? Who would have thought that external forces would be drawn into the sacred combat of Ol Mahum warriors... The power vacuum of leadership has made the situation intolerable. I fear …",
   "header": "Messenger",
   "when": [
    "state CREATED; BANDIT_STRONGHOLD.isWaitingBattle(); !((clan == null) || (clan.getLevel() < 4)); player.isClanLeader(); !((clan.getHideoutId() > 0) || (clan.getFortId() > 0) || (clan.getCastleId() > 0))"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Participate in the preliminary contest for the clan hall siege.",
